# CR 109.5, 604.1: each Prayers benefits its own controller. After Bot2 loses theirs, their remaining energy cannot use Bot1s Prayers, while Bot1 still can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Primal Prayers
Force of Vigor
Giant Growth
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Primal Prayers
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Primal Prayers)
Bot2.Choose(Primal Prayers)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Energy = 2
? Bot2.Energy = 2
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast(Ability: Pay {E})
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Force of Vigor.Cast(Ability: Exile)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Primal Prayers)
Bot1.Choose(Giant Growth)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Energy = 1
! Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast(Ability: Pay {E})
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast(Ability: Pay {E})

[Expect]
Bot1.Energy = 1
Bot2.Energy = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Primal Prayers; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Primal Prayers
